      "stem": "If a sum of money doubles itself in 5 years at simple interest, in how many years will it become 4 times of itself?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "12 years"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "15 years"
        },
        {
