        },
        {
          "id": "e",
          "text": "25 years"
        }
      ],
      "type": "mcq",
      "topic_id": "si-ci",
      "difficulty_assigned": 2,
      "status": "live",
      "source": "manual",
      "version": 1
    },
    "key": {
      "question_id": "q-upload-1793181657692-20xu",
      "correct_option": "b",
      "solution": "In 5 years, Interest = P. Rate = (P*100)/(P*5) = 20%. To become 4 times, Interest = 3P. Time = (3P*100)/(P*20) = 15 years.",
      "shortcut": "Time ratio = (N2 - 1)/(N1 - 1) = (4 - 1)/(2 - 1) = 3. Total time = 3 * 5 = 15 years."
